     "body": "<p>See also wiki: <a href=\"http://fedora-commons.org/confluence/display/FCREPO/Re-Implementing+Service+Deployment\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://fedora-commons.org/confluence/display/FCREPO/Re-Implementing+Service+Deployment</a></p>",
