      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>Renaming to more accurately reflect the work planned.</p>\n\n<p>This work should allow an sdep implementation to be indicated by the sdep object's content model, and for the relevant implementation to be loaded via Spring.</p>",
